# devel/freegrok (WIP)

Pinned source intent: local freegrok checkout (network cargo until CARGO_CRATES).

## Local package + install (FreeBSD pkg)

```sh
cd /path/to/cloudbsd-ports-grok
make -C devel/freegrok FREEGROK_SRC=$HOME/git/grok-build FORCE_CARGO_BUILD=yes package
# as root:
pkg delete -y grok-build   # if the old package is installed
pkg install -U devel/freegrok/work/pkg/freegrok-*.pkg
```

Installs:
- `/usr/local/bin/freegrok` (primary)
- `/usr/local/bin/freegrok-static` (second full binary, separate inode)
- `/usr/local/bin/fg` (short alias)
- `/usr/local/bin/grok` and `/usr/local/bin/grok-build` (compat)

`GROK_SRC` is accepted as an alias for `FREEGROK_SRC`.
